{{also|Cognac}}
==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈkɒnjæk/}}

===Etymology===
{{etyl|fr}} {{term|cognac|lang=fr}}, from {{term|Cognac}}, a city in France, from {{etyl|ML.|en}} {{term|Comniacum|lang=la}}, from the name {{term|Cominius|lang=es}} + Gallo-Roman suffix [[-acum]].

===Noun===
{{wikipedia|Cognac (drink)}}
{{en-noun}}

# a [[brandy]] [[distilled]] from [[white wine]] in the [[region]] around [[Cognac]] in [[France]]
#: ''Major manufacturers add a small proportion of caramel to colour their '''cognacs'''.''

